      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The central part of Acre Selund is the \"Megadosys\r\nPlateau\" where the royal capital is located, but\r\nin terms of a place where the Fire Dragon rests,\r\nthe importance of the \"Urteca\r\nMountains\" exceeds it.",
        "Jp" : "アッカーシェランの中央部といえば\r\n王都のある《メガドシス高地》だが\r\n火竜様がお休みになる場という意味では\r\n《ウルテカ山岳》の重要度はそれを上回る"
