      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The Urteca Mountains are where\r\nthe Fire Dragon rests.\r\nThe land is an important place.\r\nThat the land can now withstand the interference\r\nof The Evil Dragon is a blessing in disguise.",
